jobs.description:
As an Industrial Cleaning Specialist, your primary responsibility is to clean and prepare returned packaging materials for reuse. This includes removing stickers, barcodes, and labels, as well as occasionally disassembling and reassembling products. The job is both physically active and varied, offering you new challenges every day. If you thrive on being hands-on and enjoy an active role, this is the perfect opportunity for you.

Your key tasks include:

- Cleaning formwork and other packaging materials;
- Removing stickers, barcodes, and labels without damaging surfaces;
- Disassembling and reassembling products as needed.

You’ll work in two shifts: early (06:00–15:00) and late (15:00–00:00), ensuring flexibility and variety in your schedule.

- Proficiency in English;
- Physical fitness and ability to perform active work throughout the day;
- Availability for two-shift work without exceptions.
